         L     15,ADTVD
         BALR  14,15
         MVC   0(2,2),ADTB+6       YY
         MVC   2(2,2),ADTB         MM
         MVC   4(2,2),ADTB+3       DD
         B     ADTX
ADT200   MVC   0(5,2),ADTZ+2       YYDDD
         B     ADTX
ADT300   TIME  DEC                 R0 = HHMMSSth
